# YourBrand

> One or two sentences describing what YourBrand is, who it's for, and what makes
> it authoritative. This top block gives AI systems the context to summarize you.

This file curates YourBrand's best, most citable content for AI assistants. Keep it to
10–30 of your strongest, answer-dense pages. Every URL listed here must also be crawlable
(not blocked in robots.txt). Refresh it when you publish major cornerstone content.

## Core guides
- [Complete Guide to X](https://example.com/guides/x): Definitive 3,000-word guide covering what X is, how it works, pricing, and a step-by-step setup checklist. Includes original benchmark data from 2026.
- [X vs Y: Full Comparison](https://example.com/compare/x-vs-y): Side-by-side comparison table of features, pricing, and use cases, with a recommendation by scenario.

## Product & pricing
- [Pricing & Plans](https://example.com/pricing): Full plan breakdown, what each tier includes, and total cost examples. Answers "how much does YourBrand cost?".
- [Product Overview](https://example.com/product): What YourBrand does, key features, and who it's for.

## Answers & FAQ
- [Frequently Asked Questions](https://example.com/faq): Direct answers to the most common questions about setup, billing, security, and integrations.

## About & trust
- [About YourBrand](https://example.com/about): Company background, team credentials, and the expertise behind the content.

